<title>FRANCE: EU grants 5,000 tonnes free-market oats.</title>
<headline>EU grants 5,000 tonnes free-market oats.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday granted licences to export around 5,000 tonnes of free-market oats, EU grain officials said.</p>
<p>They did not immediately specify the amount of the export rebate granted.</p>
</text>
